      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {foundingPerks.map((perk) => (
          <article class="rounded-3xl border border-sand bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft">
            <h3 class="text-xl">{perk.title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-muted">{perk.text}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/pilot" class="btn btn-primary">
          Express interest
        </a>
        <a href="/customers" class="btn btn-ghost">
          Explore the pilot plan
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trust band -->
  <section class="bg-ink py-16 text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-bright">Trust</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-3xl">Every sale has a record. Every stock change has a reason.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sand">The backend is being designed around merchant permissions, verified payment events and an audit trail. Refunds and stock corrections need explicit actions; there’s no magic undo for a settled payment.</p>
      <a href="/trust" class="btn btn-on-dark mt-6">
        Trust &amp; security
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing teaser -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl">Simple prices in naira</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-muted">
      A proposed starting point, ready to test with founding merchants.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
      Pilot pricing proposed from {naira(5000)} / month. Scope and access are agreed before any billing.
    </p>
